WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:36.110
Riders in the Skies

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.780
Kamille... Why is it so quiet...?

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:55.280
You'll exhaust yourself if you talk!

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.840
Once things calm down,
we'll return to the Argama.

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.580
Hang on just a little longer.

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:01.980
It's all right.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:04.020
Kamille.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:05.080
Lieutenant.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.230
Kamille!

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:09.760
Absorb my life from me.

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:13.360
Absorb my life!

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:14.920
And win!

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:16.500
Lieutenant.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.270
I saw it.

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:22.710
The Zeta Gundam has the ability to
suck in the wills of other people...

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.470
...and turn it into its own strength.

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:26.410
So...!

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:27.540
I can't...!

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.180
Sure you can!

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.680
And with it,
you can put an end to this war.

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:35.120
You're the one to do it!

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:36.990
Kamille Bidan!

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.590
All right, Lieutenant Emma.

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:46.130
Many people... are watching over you...!

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:49.000
You're not alone.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:51.970
Y-Yes...!

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:54.640
Miss Emma!

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:57.800
There's nothing to feel lonely for.

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:58.610
Miss Emma!

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.480
Lieutenant Emma!!

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.470
Kamille!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.140
Fa! What are you doing?!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.210
I'm sorry!

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.540
I was sure... I was sure I heard Kamille!

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.250
How about it, Samarn?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.380
The enemy seems to be in disarray!

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.420
I'll quickly get the numbers for you!

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:46.650
If we can lure them more toward us...

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:48.690
...we'd be able to destroy
a few more ships.

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:51.090
Are we using the Colony Laser?

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.130
That's right!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.520
Send a coded message
to the troops on Gryps 2!

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:55.760
- Roger!
- We can't!

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:57.830
The Minovsky particles are too dense!

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:00.130
If we can't reach them,
then we'll move closer!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.170
Hurry!

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:04.400
What is it?!

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:07.740
There are three mobile suits
headed toward the Colony Laser!

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.840
Tell Kamille to protect the Laser!

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:10.880
Yes, sir!

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.960
I can't allow Scirocco to destroy the Laser!

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:44.750
I'm not letting them hit the Titans' fleet.
Now where's the core?

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.880
That must be it!

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:55.630
Damn Scirocco.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.160
Scirocco.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.200
He's planning to destroy the Laser.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:03.000
Interesting.

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:09.230
If he does any more damage,
we can no longer fire it!

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:17.650
Have you come to die? Char!!

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:27.690
Haman!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:41.100
You slipped up, Char!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.370
You shall curse yourself for ending
your life in a place like this!

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:46.380
Don't be so sure!

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:54.620
If you have any intention of coming back
to serve under me...!

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:56.250
Stop the nonsense!

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:57.880
<i>You've chosen the wrong path!</i>

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:02.720
Newtype wannabes like you
are destined to be purged!

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:04.090
Do you understand?!

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:08.860
Not yet!

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.370
This won't end yet!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.180
Lieutenant Emma.

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:30.310
Kamille Bidan. Let's do it.

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:41.130
Damn Char!

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:42.960
Did he escape into the residential district?

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.070
That woman.

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:49.510
Is she trying to kill Char all on her own?

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.910
Interesting...!

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.150
Hey, Manack!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.450
Manack! Come on!

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:05.320
Medical squad!

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.850
At this point, we're a sitting duck!

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:09.690
- We must retreat!
- No!

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:11.890
The Argama will act as a decoy
to lure the enemy!

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:12.860
She won't last!

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.350
Make her last!

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:15.760
Torres!

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.300
Isn't the Colony Laser ready to fire yet?!

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:19.800
Damage to the transformers
is significant...

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.700
...so the output cannot reach
sufficient levels yet!

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:23.140
Make them hurry!

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:26.000
Saegusa, be ready so we can
escape any time!

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:26.840
Roger!

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:29.240
An abandoned theater?

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:33.880
Char! Drop your gun!

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:35.790
Haman!

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.920
You were quite the actor, Char.

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:43.690
If you're not open to discussion...

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:45.860
...perhaps this will be where you die.

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:47.800
No.

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:50.270
Not until we introduce the other actor.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.730
You're right.

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:57.800
Being this theatrical must be
right up Scirocco's alley.

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.570
Being a mere witness to the history...

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:02.610
...perhaps I may appear that way.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:05.080
But I am calmer than Char!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.240
Do you mean I'm not calm?

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:09.190
Yes, I do!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.520
You want the world
within your own grasp!

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.890
Scirocco's right, isn't he, Char?

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:20.730
Then why don't you help me
in reviving the Zabi Family?

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.560
After that, let's think together
about the world!

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:29.900
Once we've killed
this bothersome observer.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:31.380
Haman!

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:35.880
I just don't want to take the world
in a wrong direction!

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:38.350
Then let me ask you.

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:41.220
Suppose you defeat the Zabi Family
and get rid of the Titans!

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:44.120
What do you plan
to do with the world then?

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.590
Even if I do nothing...

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:49.290
...humanity will change
as it awakens to Newtypes.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:50.730
I'll wait for that time to come.

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.960
If you don't side with me,
I'll simply eliminate you!

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.260
Once that's done,
then I'll revive the Zabi Family!

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:04.070
That'll be easy for people to understand,
and provide them with a way!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:07.540
Don't you realize that you're just
repeating the same mistake?!

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:11.250
Men who are unable to see
the necessities of this world...

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.580
- ...shall be eliminated!
- You're wrong!

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:16.390
Kamille!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.530
Is Kamille doing this?

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:34.630
Those who really need
to be eliminated...

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:37.770
...are the ones whose souls
are being pulled by Earth's gravity!

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:41.940
However, even that cause is not
worth so many people's lives.

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:43.740
What a stupid thing to say!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.740
You may be able to move common people
by showing off your raw emotions...

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.580
...but it won't work against us!

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:53.790
What good will building a world
that ignores people's minds do?!

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:57.520
What have common people
done for the world?!

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:58.960
They only weigh down the geniuses!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:02.360
The world has always been run
by a mere handful of geniuses!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:03.560
That's not true!

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:06.030
- Kamille, get out of here!
- I won't!

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:07.510
Hey, kid!

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:10.840
Petty sentiment will only direct
the world on a path to destruction!

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:12.740
Kamille.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:13.470
You guys can...!

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.950
Kamille! Hurry outside!

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:20.110
Let's go, Kamille!

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:35.720
We're leaving the colony!

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:36.770
Yes!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.500
What's the latest with Gryps 2?!

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:41.130
Critical state at 30 percent output!

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:42.570
- Ready to go!
- Good!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:50.720
It's Haman!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:56.220
Is the Colony Laser going to be fired?

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:02.620
That's not good!

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.090
Should the Colony Laser be fired now...!

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:07.930
The Zeta?!

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:11.670
Never mind it!

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:14.600
If we don't escape now, we'll be
burned up when the Colony Laser fires!

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.940
Like a little child!

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:20.680
Please go ahead!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.240
I'll put an end to this right here!

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:26.380
I have a response!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.180
Gryps 2 is prepared to fire!

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.240
Good!

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:33.750
Wait!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.090
What's the matter, Captain?!

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:40.030
- Stand by, remain prepared to fire!
- We can't stand by! Our targets are moving!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:41.930
I said stand by!

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.530
The Laser's about to be fired!
Fa, don't return there!

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.070
But Kamille's...!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.570
I'll bring Kamille back myself!

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:54.200
What are you doing here, Lieutenant?!

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:56.800
I told you that I'll take care of
Haman and Scirocco!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.130
Dr. Hasan!

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.000
- Mr. Manack is in trouble!
- Manack is!

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:25.140
I thought I told you two
to remain in your room!

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:26.200
No way!

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:27.710
I'm too scared!

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:31.340
It's dangerous here!
We'll move further to the back!

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:33.380
- Right!
- You two come also!

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:35.250
Gryps 2 energy at critical state!

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:37.450
Our targets will get away
unless we fire now!

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:38.820
Captain!

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:40.050
I know!

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:43.090
Kamille and the others
are inside the Laser cannon!

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:46.560
We'll wait until they all get out!

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:55.200
You know, once a Colony Laser is
critically charged, it could explode!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.910
Your luck is about to run out, Kamille.

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:12.850
<i>Are you all right?!</i>

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:14.860
The Methuss isn't capable of
dodging her weapon!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:17.390
I know that! However...!

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.000
Lieutenant!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.700
We'll escape this place together, Kamille!

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:27.740
<i>You still have something left to do.</i>

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:28.970
<i>In this war...!</i>

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:31.810
The people who have died in this war
sacrificed their lives...

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:34.040
...believing the world would be saved
as a result.

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:35.740
I also believe in you!

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:40.950
Do you think the world will be saved
with youngsters like you losing their lives?!

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:43.550
<i>Kamille!</i>

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:44.590
Lieutenant!

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:47.480
It's not the elderly who will
build the new era!

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:50.430
Are they out?

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:57.540
Okay!

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:58.860
Fire the Colony Laser!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:00.060
Roger!

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:17.120
Captain!

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:29.960
W-We can no longer beat
the A.E.U.G.!

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.260
This isn't good.

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:38.770
What's the matter, Haman?

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:42.010
I'll stop the A.E.U.G. even
if it means my life.

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:44.440
Meanwhile we shall withdraw
our main ships.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.510
Are we in danger?

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:47.890
No.

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:49.720
Our battle will continue for some time.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.150
But if we exhaust our resources now,
we'll end up like the Titans.

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.190
I'll leave it to you, Haman.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:57.060
Yes! I'm on my way!

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:02.290
This must be a fierce battle!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.690
You're not getting away!

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.840
You even fail to see
the reality in front of you!

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:15.610
Stop talking nonsense,
you smart-ass boy!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:16.940
Better smart than delusional!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:22.780
Where's the Jupitris?

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.460
Is that it?!

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:30.360
Out of energy?!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:35.430
You're careless!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:43.370
Now!

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:57.020
You can no longer use
that weapon, Haman!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.190
Not so easy, Char!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:02.560
What?!

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:09.030
Shall we end it here, Char,
or do you want to continue?!

00:16:09.630 --> 00:16:12.030
Do you believe you've got
the right to decide that?!

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.670
<i>You'd better</i>
<i>choose your words carefully!</i>

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:22.670
What?!

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.690
Char.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.460
If only you had decided to come with me.

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:47.710
Scirocco!

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:48.600
Where are you?!

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:01.040
It's you!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:04.920
Always watching from the sidelines
and making sport of others!

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:07.350
Don't think you can beat me, kid!

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:11.400
I cannot forgive him!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.590
Even if I must sacrifice my life,
my body for it...

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:15.720
...I'll never forgive him!

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.630
What's going on with him?!

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:20.500
I'm sure you all understand!

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:23.510
Bastards like him
must not be allowed to live!

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:25.500
I'm sure you understand!

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.040
A-All of you!

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:28.440
I know you all understand!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:34.810
<i>You're getting too hasty!</i>
<i>That's the problem!</i>

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:44.030
<i>Your powers are too different.</i>

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:46.660
<i>What do you do in such a case?</i>

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.030
I'll let you use my body!

00:17:55.910 --> 00:17:57.840
<i>Good move, Kamille!</i>

00:17:57.980 --> 00:18:01.280
<i>People are so concerned about life</i>
<i>and death in the physical world...</i>

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.900
<i>...that they focus on the wrong things!</i>

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:04.310
<i>No!</i>

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.410
Give it a rest!

00:18:07.050 --> 00:18:08.490
<i>Sarah! Out of the way!</i>

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:11.490
<i>Yes! It's not something</i>
<i>that a child can understand!</i>

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.920
<i>Right now,</i>
<i>we must leave things to Kamille!</i>

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:16.190
<i>No way! Mr. Paptimus is...!</i>

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:19.260
He's a man that must not live
in these times!

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:20.860
Please understand, Sarah!

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:21.960
<i>No way!</i>

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:23.830
<i>Mr. Paptimus is my...!</i>

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:28.300
<i>Why do you keep thinking</i>
<i>with your head alone?</i>

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.070
<i>By doing that...</i>

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:32.840
<i>...you'll only tire yourself, Sarah.</i>

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:36.440
<i>But, unless I do that... I...!</i>

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:41.050
<i>Look at what Kamille's looking at.</i>

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:48.350
<i>Even the person in there</i>
<i>can easily merge like we do.</i>

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:49.980
- <i>Really?</i>
- <i>Yeah.</i>

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:52.200
The Z-Zeta.

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:54.090
What's happening to it?

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:01.810
Is there still a weapon in there
that I'm not aware of?

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:03.130
You wouldn't understand!

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.400
You, Scirocco,
who thinks of war as a game.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.710
You wouldn't understand the power
moving through my body!

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:11.810
Power moving through your body?

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:16.250
How could such a thing possibly
defeat a mobile suit?!

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:17.680
What?!

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:21.720
<i>Kamille is in a machine</i>
<i>that puts such power to use.</i>

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:24.190
<i>The Zeta Gundam.</i>

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:26.090
Women's voices?

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:28.390
If you still fight back...!

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.030
The O!

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:43.210
M-Move! The O!

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:44.310
Why won't you move?!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.120
Disappear from here!

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:57.420
I'm not about to die alone.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.200
I'm taking your soul with me.

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:05.470
Kamille Bidan.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.000
S-Scirocco...!

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:10.740
Did I get him?

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:16.010
Hey... Light.

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:17.570
The light is spreading.

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.850
Kamille?

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.420
Kamille! You're alive, right?!

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.260
Kamille! Answer me!

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:38.160
Kamille!

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:48.400
A large star is turning on and off.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.340
It's huge!

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.320
Is it a comet?!

00:20:54.590 --> 00:20:56.280
No, it can't be.

00:20:56.350 --> 00:21:00.760
A comet moves like, swoosh!

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:09.460
It's really hot in here.

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:14.800
There must be a way out.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:20.040
Hey!

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:23.110
Please get me out of here! Hey!

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:27.690
C-Captain.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:29.750
Captain Bright.

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:32.280
Kamille Bidan's...!

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.420
Can you hear me? Argama?

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:46.430
I see.

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:48.400
Do you want to return to
the Argama too?

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw
